## ```pengu
## var xs as list of int is [3, 1, 2]
## calling reverse with xs    # [2, 1, 3]
## ```
weave reverse shard T with l as list of T into list of T:
    var out as list of T is for x in l then x
    let n as int is calling out.len
    var i as int is 0
    while i < (n / 2):
        let tmp as T is out at i
        set out at i is (out at (n - 1 - i))
        set out at (n - 1 - i) is tmp
        set i is i + 1
    return out

