##
## ## Retorno
## A new owned `list of T`; release it with `banish`.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## var xs as list of int is [3, 1, 2]
## calling map_square with xs    # [9, 1, 4]
## ```
weave map_square shard T where T: Num with l as list of T into list of T:
    return for x in l then (x * x)

## Functional form of `map_negate`: copy with every element negated.
##
## ## Parámetros
