##
## ## Retorno
## A new owned `list of T`; release it with `banish`.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## var xs as list of int is [3, -1]
## calling map_negate with xs    # [-3, 1]
## ```
weave map_negate shard T where T: Num with l as list of T into list of T:
    return for x in l then (0 - x)

## Functional form of `map_add_scalar`: copy with `k` added to every element.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `l`: the list to map. Read only.
## - `k`: the value added to each element.
##
## ## Retorno
## A new owned `list of T`; release it with `banish`.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## var xs as list of int is [3, 1]
## calling map_add_scalar with xs, 10    # [13, 11]
## ```
weave map_add_scalar shard T where T: Num with l as list of T, k as T into list of T:
    return for x in l then (x + k)

## Functional form of `map_increment`: copy with `delta` added to every element.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `l`: the list to map. Read only.
## - `delta`: the integer added to each element; defaults to 1.
##
## ## Retorno
